{"n": 372, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "372.webp", "text": "23-6\n\n2313010 REMOVING AND INSTALLING To avoid damage on threads, screw on the nuts.\nOR REPLACING VIBRATION Press out staybolts,\nDAMPER Take off vibration damper\n\nUnscrew front end of propeller shaft and\ncenter mount — see 23 00 020 / 022.\nApply Special Too! 23 1 200.\n\nHold output flange with Special Tool\n\n23 1320.\n\nUnscrew collar nut with Special Tool\n\n23 1210.\n\nInstallation:\n\nInstall collar nut with bolt cement**.\nTightening torque*.\n\n“231320\n\nPlace bore of output flange on a suitable piece\nof pipe.\n\nMount vibration damper (1) with staybolts.\nPress in staybolts.\n\nimportant!\n\nStaybolts must be pressed in with the flat end\nfacing the vibration damper\n\nPull off output flange with Special Tool\n331 150.\n\nVibration damper (1) is mounted on the\noutput flange with three staybolts.\n\nPress staybolts out of the output flange.\nInsert suitable pieces of round steel stock\non both sides.\n\n* See Specifications\n** Source: HWB", "words": [["23-6", 0.463, 0.0199, 0.5142, 0.0438], ["2313010", 0.266, 0.0637, 0.3151, 0.0743], ["REMOVING", 0.3283, 0.0637, 0.388, 0.0749], ["AND", 0.3921, 0.0643, 0.4159, 0.0749], ["INSTALLING", 0.42, 0.0643, 0.4868, 0.0756], ["To", 0.7594, 0.065, 0.773, 0.0756], ["avoid", 0.7761, 0.0656, 0.8014, 0.0756], ["damage", 0.8055, 0.065, 0.8414, 0.0782], ["on", 0.8445, 0.0676, 0.8566, 0.0756], ["threads,", 0.8607, 0.065, 0.8977, 0.0763], ["screw", 0.9017, 0.0676, 0.9281, 0.0749], ["on", 0.9321, 0.0676, 0.9433, 0.0749], ["the", 0.9473, 0.065, 0.9615, 0.0749], ["nuts.", 0.9656, 0.067, 0.9848, 0.0749], ["OR", 0.3278, 0.0796, 0.343, 0.0902], ["REPLACING", 0.3475, 0.0796, 0.4103, 0.0908], ["VIBRATION", 0.4144, 0.0802, 0.4767, 0.0915], ["Press", 0.7589, 0.0802, 0.7832, 0.0915], ["out", 0.7867, 0.0829, 0.8019, 0.0915], ["staybolts,", 0.8065, 0.0809, 0.8521, 0.0935], ["DAMPER", 0.3278, 0.0955, 0.3734, 0.1068], ["Take", 0.7594, 0.0968, 0.7832, 0.1074], ["off", 0.7867